AltoBorrowMarket::accrueInterest()
├── when market is paused
│   └── it should revert
└── when market is not paused
    ├── when irm is zero address
    │   └── it should do nothing
    └── when irm is not zero address
        ├── when interestFee is zero
        │   ├── it should update totalSupply.assets and totalBorrowed.assets
        │   ├── it should emit AccrueInterest event
        │   └── it should not accrue fee shares
        └── when interestFee is non-zero
            ├── it should update totalSupply.assets and totalBorrowed.assets
            ├── it should emit AccrueInterest event
            ├── it should update feeRecipient's supplyShares
            ├── it should update totalSupply.shares
            └── it should emit InterestFeeAccrued event
